      "id": "claim_53b0eda29b52478b8748eda92dd3c079",
      "statement": "The MCP trust tiers are 'vetted' (deployment asserted the endpoint's annotations are reliable, so destructiveHint:false + idempotentHint:true may drive auto-approval) and 'byo' (a user typed the URL in; readOnlyHint still classifies reads but nothing else can auto-apply a write); only the MCP portal can produce a vetted endpoint via MCP_PORTAL_TRUST_ANNOTATIONS, and neither tier can be shared.",
