      "id": "claim_ddb32b9f9daa45439a74ef919cda08c5",
      "statement": "In gatekeeper-cloudflare observability, observability-api.ts is the only place that talks HTTP, and deniesAccess maps only 400/401/403/404 to credential-lacks-access: a 5xx or transport error is the gatekeeper's problem and must never be reported as a denial (which would be a silent authorization decision) nor allowed (which would admit an unauthorized reader).",
