    {
      "id": "claim_464ec81f85c746f4a34f749a2afc62e3",
      "statement": "Worker-scoped observability bindings prepend an immutable $metadata.service filter and re-filter the response, because provider telemetry/keys and telemetry/values ignore the filters they accept; a dropped event proves the filter was not applied, so the provider's own count is withheld (it would count the whole account) and the drop is logged at error, while statistics is kept.",
      "evidence": [
