        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1cebc32381b147fda69fc54421943e9f",
      "statement": "A provider error message can quote a caller-supplied filter value back, so only numeric codes are logged: filter values stay out of the audit trail (summarizeFilter) and the message travels to the caller who caused it.",
